'''Monk [[Krytan armor]]''' is an art type introduced in the Prophecies campaign as [[Monk collector armor|collector armor]] and is also available in the Factions campaign.

'''Note''': Monk Krytan armor art does not have headgear. The [[Monk Dragon armor|Dragon Scalp Design]] is used as collector scalp design in Prophecies and it is also available from Oroku in Factions. Pictures, crafting and collecting details are available on that page.

There is no [[Prestige armor|prestige]] version of Krytan armor (although Elite [[Saintly armor]] uses the same model).

This armor set dyes lighter if acquired from Factions.

